* [International Telecommunication Union — Internet of Things](https://www.itu.int/en/ITU-T/techwatch/Pages/IoT.aspx)
* [U.S. Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency — Internet of Things](https://www.cisa.gov/topics/cyber-threats-and-advisories/internet-things)
