* Microsoft. ["What Is Data Visualization?"](https://www.microsoft.com/en/power-platform/products/power-bi/topics/data-visualization)
* Microsoft. ["Business Analytics Tools and Why They Matter."](https://www.microsoft.com/en/power-platform/products/power-bi/topics/analytics/business-analytics-tools)
* McElheran, Kristina, and Erik Brynjolfsson. ["The Rise of Data-Driven Decision Making Is Real but Uneven."](https://hbr.org/2016/02/the-rise-of-data-driven-decision-making-is-real-but-uneven) Harvard Business Review, 2016.
* Luca, Michael, and Amy C. Edmondson. ["Where Data-Driven Decision-Making Can Go Wrong."](https://hbr.org/2024/09/where-data-driven-decision-making-can-go-wrong) Harvard Business Review, 2024.
