* IBM. "What Is Master Data Management?" — [IBM Master Data Management](https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/master-data-management)
* Microsoft. "Master Data Management in Microsoft Purview." — [Microsoft Purview Master Data Management](https://learn.microsoft.com/id-id/purview/data-governance-master-data-management)
* Microsoft. "Microsoft Purview Data Governance." — [Microsoft Purview Data Governance](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/business/risk-management/microsoft-purview-data-governance/)
* IBM. "Master Data Management Solutions." — [IBM Master Data Management Solutions](https://www.ibm.com/solutions/master-data-management)
