* [Google Skillshop Help — Professional certifications for Skillshop Google Ads/GMP/GA](https://support.google.com/skillshop/answer/14746215?hl=en)
* [Google Ads Help — Google Partners certification requirements](https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/9702452?hl=en)
